WEBVTT

00:03:27.026 --> 00:03:31.491
lazem yeṣra hna, fi dati.

00:03:31.491 --> 00:03:35.591
Hada huwa jwabi w sirti mɛa el-ḥogra

00:03:35.591 --> 00:03:38.442
elli lazem netḥekkem fihum,

00:03:38.442 --> 00:03:40.742
w elli nnejjem ndir keš ḥaja lihum.

00:03:40.742 --> 00:03:44.925
W elli nestḥeq nkkebru huwa el-meɛrifa ntaɛ dati beš nḥeqqu.

00:03:44.925 --> 00:03:47.424
Meɛnatu, nestḥeqq neɛref kifeš netwasa,

00:03:47.424 --> 00:03:49.675
ki nefšel,

00:03:49.675 --> 00:03:54.009
win rahum xṣayli el-mxeyrin,

00:03:54.009 --> 00:03:56.507
win rani naqeṣ.

00:03:56.507 --> 00:03:57.975
Winta nesmeḥ?

00:03:57.975 --> 00:04:03.238
Weš huwa elli ndafeɛ ɛlih?